<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus accepts Nichimen tenders for wheat.</title>
<headline>Cyprus accepts Nichimen tenders for wheat.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission said it accepted tenders from Nichimen Corp for 12,000 tonnes of U.S. No 22 NSIDNS or CWRS wheat at $197.22 C and F, and for 6,000 tonnes of U.S. No 2 HAD or CWAD wheat at $228.09 per tonne C and F.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom, 357 2 469623i</p>
</text>
